  "id": "com.macrohandler.local_visual_decision",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "name": "Local AI Visual Decision",
  "description": "Offline multi-model visual decisions and bounded number/text outputs for the reviewed Macro Handler 1.0.52 multitask build. Select separate verified SmolVLM-256M, SmolVLM-500M, LFM2.5-VL-450M or Qwen3-VL-2B model data; Qwen needs at least 2048 MB available RAM. Model weights are not embedded in this plugin or APK. No API key, cloud fallback or remote executable engine. LFM has its own commercial eligibility/license acceptance. An explicit Arithmetic OCR task uses the existing local OCR and arithmetic engine without model weights for a single basic expression. Existing regions, prompt variables and True/False/Unknown/Error actions are preserved. Number/text True means completed output, not verified factual correctness. Truncated replies fail closed. UI supports 14 app languages; model accuracy and latency vary. No calibrated confidence, target coordinates, exact pixel or universal maths/game guarantee. Read the English model/capability guide before downloading.",
  "author": "Macro Handler",
